>> title: Flour Tortillas
>> category: Flatbreads & Pancakes
>> tags: bread, mexican, skillet, dough
>> counters: Taquería
>> aka: tortillas de harina
>> pairs-with: refried-beans, mexican-red-rice
>> servings: 12
>> time: 1 hr

Whisk @all-purpose flour{3%cup}(390 g), @baking powder{1%tsp}(4 g), and @fine sea salt{1 1/2%tsp}(9 g).

Rub @lard{1/3%cup}(75 g; or vegetable shortening) into @&(~1)flour{}.

Knead @&(~1)mixture{} into a soft dough with @warm water{1%cup}(240 mL).

Rest @&(~1)dough{} covered ~{30%min}.

Roll @&(~1)dough{} thin and cook in a dry #cast-iron skillet{} ~{45%sec} per side.
